sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant AdminAPI as Admin API
    participant CreateFulfillmentWF as createFulfillmentWorkflow
    participant FulfillmentService as IFulfillmentModuleService
    participant ProviderService as FulfillmentProviderService
    participant Provider as IFulfillmentProvider (manual/carrier)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Admin->>AdminAPI: POST /admin/fulfillments\n{ location_id, items, address, shipping_option_id }
    AdminAPI->>CreateFulfillmentWF: run({ input })

    CreateFulfillmentWF->>FulfillmentService: validateFulfillmentData(providerId, optionData, data)
    FulfillmentService->>ProviderService: resolve provider from container
    ProviderService->>Provider: validateFulfillmentData(data, items, context)
    Provider-->>ProviderService: validated data
    ProviderService-->>FulfillmentService: OK

    CreateFulfillmentWF->>FulfillmentService: createFulfillment(data, items, order, shippingOption)
    FulfillmentService->>DB: INSERT fulfillment (location_id, requires_shipping, ...)
    DB-->>FulfillmentService: Fulfillment record

    FulfillmentService->>DB: INSERT fulfillment_items (title, sku, barcode, quantity, ...)
    FulfillmentService->>DB: INSERT fulfillment_address (snapshot of delivery address)

    FulfillmentService->>ProviderService: createFulfillment(data, items, order, fulfillmentRecord)
    ProviderService->>Provider: createFulfillment(...)
    Provider-->>ProviderService: { data: { carrier_id, tracking_ref, ... } }

    FulfillmentService->>DB: UPDATE fulfillment SET data = provider_response
    DB-->>FulfillmentService: Updated Fulfillment

    FulfillmentService-->>CreateFulfillmentWF: FulfillmentDTO
    CreateFulfillmentWF-->>AdminAPI: FulfillmentDTO
    AdminAPI-->>Admin: 201 Created { fulfillment }

    Note over Admin, DB: Later: Mark as Shipped
    Admin->>AdminAPI: POST /admin/fulfillments/:id/shipment\n{ labels: [{ tracking_number, tracking_url, label_url }] }
    AdminAPI->>FulfillmentService: createShipment(id, labels)
    FulfillmentService->>DB: UPDATE fulfillment SET shipped_at = NOW(), marked_shipped_by = userId
    FulfillmentService->>DB: INSERT fulfillment_labels (tracking_number, tracking_url, label_url)
    DB-->>FulfillmentService: Updated Fulfillment + Labels
    FulfillmentService-->>AdminAPI: FulfillmentDTO with labels
    AdminAPI-->>Admin: 200 OK { fulfillment }

    Note over Admin, DB: Compensation (if workflow fails)
    CreateFulfillmentWF->>FulfillmentService: cancelFulfillment(id)
    FulfillmentService->>Provider: cancelFulfillment(data)
    FulfillmentService->>DB: UPDATE fulfillment SET canceled_at = NOW()
